#: ../../library/dbm.rst:31
msgid ""
"This function attempts to guess which of the several simple database modules "
"available --- :mod:`dbm.sqlite3`, :mod:`dbm.gnu`, :mod:`dbm.ndbm`, or :mod:"
"`dbm.dumb` --- should be used to open a given file."
